            "paragraph": "The atmosphere component ECHAM5 is the fifth generation of the ECHAM model series that originally evolved from the weather prediction model of the European Centre for Medium Range Weather Forecasts. The details of ECHAM5 are comprehensively described in Roeckner et al. (2003). ... The shortwave radiation scheme (Fouquart and Bonnel 1980) uses four spectral bands.",
