            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalScheme",
            "paragraph": "The atmosphere component ECHAM5 is the fifth generation of the ECHAM model series that originally evolved from the weather prediction model of the European Centre for Medium Range Weather Forecasts. ... For longwave radiation ECHAM5 employs the Rapid Radiative Transfer Model (RRTM) developed by Mlawer et al. (1997) with 16 spectral bands.",
