            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalScheme",
            "paragraph": "The atmosphere component ECHAM5 is the fifth generation of the ECHAM model series that originally evolved from the weather prediction model of the European Centre for Medium Range Weather Forecasts. ... ECHAM5 uses a stratiform cloud scheme including a cloud microphysical scheme and prognostic equations for the vapour, liquid, and ice phase, respectively.",
