            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalFeature",
            "paragraph": "Here, we use the low-resolution version of ECHAM5/MPI-OM to perform long simulations of up to 1,000 years length. The atmosphere component uses 19 vertical levels and has a horizontal resolution of T31 (~3.75\u00b0). The ocean model uses 40 vertical levels and has a horizontal resolution varying between 30 km near Greenland and 390 km in the tropical Pacific.",
